cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If this software supports your research, please cite it."
title: "ndl-mcp: an MCP server for NDL Search (国立国会図書館サーチ)"
abstract: >-
  A Model Context Protocol stdio server exposing NDL Search, operated by the
  National Diet Library of Japan, over the SRU searchRetrieve interface as six
  tools. Built to the undertakings filed with the library: serial requests at a
  minimum one-second interval, a capped record count with no auto-pagination,
  no harvesting interface, only the approved data providers reachable, credit
  carried on every response, and nothing cached. The NDL search APIs require no
  credential; the filing is a notification duty, not a key grant.
type: software
